@startuml
!include ../shortfall/style.iuml
title Partial recipe edit: replace only after validation and formatting
autonumber

participant "MishMash" as App
participant "parser: Parser" as Parser
participant "edit: EditRecipeCommand" as Edit
participant "changes: RecipeChanges" as Changes
participant "book: RecipeBook" as Book
participant "viewer: RecipeViewer" as Viewer

App -> Parser : parseCommand("edit-recipe 1 p/55")
activate Parser
Parser -> Parser : parseEditRecipe(arguments)
Parser -> Parser : collectRecipeArguments(...)
Parser -> Changes ** : new RecipeChanges(...)
Parser -> Edit ** : new EditRecipeCommand(1, changes)
Parser --> App : edit
deactivate Parser

App -> Edit : execute(book)
activate Edit
Edit -> Book : size()
Book --> Edit : recipeCount
note over Edit, Book : Reject empty book or out-of-range index before changing anything.
Edit -> Book : getRecipes()
Book --> Edit : current recipe snapshot
Edit -> Changes : applyTo(original)
activate Changes
create participant "edited: Recipe" as Edited
Changes -> Edited : new Recipe(...)
note right of Edited : Keep omitted fields from original.\nReplace supplied fields.
Changes --> Edit : edited
deactivate Changes
Edit -> Viewer : view(edited)
Viewer --> Edit : formatted recipe details
Edit -> Book : replace(0, edited)
Book --> Edit : replacement complete
Edit --> App : confirmation with updated recipe
deactivate Edit

note over Edit, Book
  The book keeps its size and order.
  Existing plans and groceries retain their original snapshots.
end note
@enduml
